# Networked Digital Libraries.

**Authors:** Borbinha, Jose Luis B., Delgado, Jose Carlos M.

## Abstract
Identifies basic concepts of a networked digital library and the effects on traditional information service and formats. Describes selected projects in information automation and delivery. Highlights research projects at six universities concerned with digitizing information to be made available via communication networks. Discusses the role of the Internet in digital libraries. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ541469

